'''Starfall Hill''' (Japanese: '''ほしふりの丘''' ''Starfall Hill'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Alola]] [[region]], featured in ''[[SM079|Showering the World with Love!]]''. Found on [[Ula'ula Island]], it is located atop [[Mount Hokulani]] near the [[Hokulani Observatory]].

Starfall Hill is known for the large amount of {{p|Minior}} that fall down there from space. The Minior land on the surface in their {{DL|List of Pokémon with form differences|Minior|Meteor Form}}, but eventually their shell cracks open. Once the Minior have lost their shell, they vanish into dust. {{an|Sophocles}} visited Starfall Hill when he was young and made friends with a Minior, only to lose it when it lost it shell.

Years later, {{Ash}} and {{ashcl}} visited Hokulani Observatory with {{an|Professor Kukui}} as part of a school trip and watched the Minior fall down from the sky at Starfall Hill. Just like Sophocles did before, [[Ash's Poipole]] befriended a Minior, only to lose its friend when it turned into dust. After all the Minior were gone, Ash and his friends spotted a {{p|Rayquaza}} in the sky.

